**Modulus and Phase**

For real \(\nu\) and positive \(x\)

**9.2.17**

\[\begin{array}{l}M_{\nu}\!=\!|H_{\nu}^{(1)}(x)|\!=\!\nu\{{\cal{J}}_{\nu}^{*}(x) +{\cal{Y}}_{\nu}^{*}(x)\}\\ \theta_{\nu}\!=\!\arg\,H_{\nu}^{(1)}(x)\!=\!\arctan\,\{\,{\cal{Y}}_{\nu}(x)/{ \cal{J}}_{\nu}(x)\}\\ \end{array}\]

**9.2.18**

\[\begin{array}{l}N_{\nu}\!=\!|H_{\nu}^{(1)^{\prime}}(x)|\!=\!\!\{{\cal{J}}_{ \nu}^{\prime}\!{}_{\nu}^{2}(x)\!+\!{\cal{Y}}_{\nu}^{*}\!{}_{\nu}^{2}(x)\}\\ \varphi_{\nu}\!=\!\arg\,H_{\nu}^{(1)^{\prime}}(x)\!=\!\arctan\,\{\,{\cal{Y}}_{ \nu}^{*}(x)/{\cal{J}}_{\nu}^{*}(x)\}\\ \end{array}\]

